WEBVTT

00:35.535 --> 00:36.411
Her?

00:38.413 --> 00:39.831
Goddess, my foot.

00:46.254 --> 00:47.505
You be the goddess instead.

00:52.093 --> 00:53.720
WELCOME TO THE NEW STUDENT ORIENTATION
FOR SAEBOM HIGH SCHOOL

00:54.429 --> 00:56.723
- Hey, it's Ju-kyung!
- She's here.

01:00.852 --> 01:02.437
She doesn't look like the photos at all.

01:02.520 --> 01:04.355
- How is that her?
- Does that look like her?

01:04.939 --> 01:07.442
Ju-kyung, is this really you?

01:07.525 --> 01:08.943
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:10.487 --> 01:12.655
The truth about Lim Ju-kyung,
Saebom High Goddess.

01:12.739 --> 01:15.158
She was known for running dumpling errands
before her transfer.

01:15.241 --> 01:16.910
You are all going to be so shocked.

01:16.993 --> 01:18.953
She's super ugly. It's all her makeup.

01:23.875 --> 01:25.460
- Gosh.
- That's not her.

01:25.543 --> 01:28.421
- This is over the line.
- This is wild.

01:48.900 --> 01:50.110
She's a fraud.

01:50.193 --> 01:52.237
Shouldn't she see a dermatologist?

02:00.662 --> 02:01.496
Ju-kyung.

02:10.380 --> 02:11.506
Ju-kyung.

02:17.011 --> 02:17.846
Ju-kyung.

02:28.189 --> 02:29.107
Hey, Ju-kyung.

02:31.526 --> 02:32.610
You, a goddess?

02:33.361 --> 02:34.362
It's ridiculous.

02:34.946 --> 02:35.780
Take her.

02:38.575 --> 02:40.493
Let me go!

02:41.327 --> 02:42.328
Let me go!

02:46.124 --> 02:47.375
Let go!

02:48.710 --> 02:49.836
Hey,

02:49.919 --> 02:52.046
weren't you dating Han Seo-jun?

02:52.130 --> 02:54.465
- And now Lee Soo-ho?
- She was two-timing.

02:54.549 --> 02:56.217
- You played them both.
- She's nuts.

02:56.301 --> 02:58.469
How did you get Lee Soo-ho with this face?

02:58.553 --> 03:00.555
How can that face turn into this?

03:00.638 --> 03:02.765
- Does he know how you actually look?
- She was two-timing.

03:02.849 --> 03:06.185
A breakup is inevitable if he didn't.
But if he knew and was dating you…

03:06.269 --> 03:07.520
Then what's wrong with him?

03:08.730 --> 03:10.857
Goddess? You've got to be kidding me.

03:11.524 --> 03:12.400
Grab her.

03:13.067 --> 03:15.778
- What are you doing?
- Don't resist.

03:15.862 --> 03:18.156
Why? I just want to
take a look at your bare face.

03:18.239 --> 03:20.867
- Don't!
- Why? We're having fun.

03:20.950 --> 03:22.493
- Stop!
- Grab her.

03:23.453 --> 03:24.662
Seriously?

03:27.290 --> 03:28.708
She's that girl?

03:28.791 --> 03:30.793
- Don't do this!
- Don't struggle, okay?

03:30.877 --> 03:32.420
Her skin looks different already.

03:32.503 --> 03:33.504
My goodness.

03:33.588 --> 03:35.340
- Don't do this!
- "Don't do this!"

03:35.423 --> 03:37.008
The post was totally true.

03:37.091 --> 03:38.968
- It's crazy.
- Look at her skin.

03:41.054 --> 03:42.430
Don't you touch her.

03:52.440 --> 03:54.108
Ju-kyung!

03:56.236 --> 03:58.780
Ju-kyung! Get out of my way!

03:59.489 --> 04:00.323
Ju-kyung!

04:01.115 --> 04:02.242
Ju-kyung!

04:06.621 --> 04:07.538
Where are you going?

04:09.123 --> 04:09.958
Are you crying?

04:14.170 --> 04:15.046
Hey, Ju-kyung!

04:21.761 --> 04:23.680
- Have you seen Ju-kyung?
- Did you two fight again?

04:23.763 --> 04:25.056
Have you seen her?

04:25.139 --> 04:26.599
She went that way.

04:29.811 --> 04:32.105
Whatever, they can fight all they want.

04:32.188 --> 04:33.022
Hey, Seo-jun!

04:33.106 --> 04:35.149
Hey, Seo-jun! It's crazy about Ju-kyung.

04:35.233 --> 04:38.611
Don't talk to me about her from now on.
I don't want to know about it.

04:38.695 --> 04:40.446
But take a look at this.

04:40.530 --> 04:41.364
Come on.

05:32.874 --> 05:35.001
BOYFRIEND

05:35.084 --> 05:38.254
The fact that he's dating you
makes him look lame as well.

05:39.047 --> 05:40.006
BOYFRIEND

05:40.089 --> 05:41.466
4 MISSED CALLS
BOYFRIEND

05:55.730 --> 05:56.856
Did you watch the video?

05:56.939 --> 05:59.442
Of course, I saw it. I almost fell for it.

05:59.525 --> 06:01.360
Ju-kyung, a goddess? Ridiculous.

06:01.444 --> 06:02.737
That's what I'm saying.

06:02.820 --> 06:05.364
- She's ugly for real.
- That's what I'm saying.

06:06.449 --> 06:07.909
- What? Say that again.
- What?

06:07.992 --> 06:09.202
What did you just say?

06:09.285 --> 06:11.079
- What?
- You bastard!

06:11.162 --> 06:12.747
What the hell?

06:13.831 --> 06:16.584
- Hey!
- What's your problem?

06:16.667 --> 06:18.628
- Shouldn't we call the teacher?
- Hey, what's with you?

06:18.711 --> 06:19.629
Don't touch me!

06:20.171 --> 06:23.424
Say it again, you bastard!

06:23.508 --> 06:25.343
- What did you just say?
- Hey!

06:25.426 --> 06:28.262
Hey, Ju-young! Stop it!

06:31.307 --> 06:32.350
Calm down.

06:38.689 --> 06:39.816
Take a seat.

06:45.905 --> 06:48.032
Calm down. Don't get worked up.

06:51.661 --> 06:54.330
Okay, great job.

06:56.332 --> 06:58.501
I'm also upset about
what happened to Ju-kyung,

06:58.584 --> 07:01.087
but don't you ever use violence
under any circumstances.

07:02.255 --> 07:04.757
There's a saying,
"Don't hit someone even with flowers."

07:05.883 --> 07:08.302
There's nothing you can't resolve
with words. Got it?

07:11.013 --> 07:11.848
Give me your hand.

07:15.893 --> 07:16.811
Are you a dog?

07:18.229 --> 07:19.063
Here.

07:19.647 --> 07:20.940
I saw your hand got scraped.

07:31.617 --> 07:33.119
Hey, she's unrecognizable, right?

07:33.202 --> 07:34.871
Gosh, I was really shocked.

07:34.954 --> 07:36.372
- She's ruined now.
- Maybe it's edited.

07:36.456 --> 07:37.915
Got something interesting?

07:37.999 --> 07:39.292
- Good morning.
- Morning, sir.

07:39.959 --> 07:41.043
- It's this way.
- I know.

07:41.127 --> 07:42.587
Let's have the morning assembly.

07:49.969 --> 07:51.721
I don't see Ju-kyung and Soo-ho.

07:54.640 --> 07:56.851
They must be on a date or something.

07:58.102 --> 07:59.437
Excuse me, sir.

07:59.520 --> 08:01.898
Ju-kyung probably won't come
to school today.

08:03.107 --> 08:04.317
Is she feeling unwell?

08:04.400 --> 08:06.944
Is it because of me?

08:07.028 --> 08:08.029
Hee-kyung!

08:08.613 --> 08:09.697
Hi.

08:09.780 --> 08:10.656
Mr. Han?

08:10.740 --> 08:13.201
- We're dating.
- Why did it have to be my teacher?

08:13.284 --> 08:15.328
How can I go to school knowing this?

08:16.913 --> 08:19.874
Sir, by the way,
Seo-jun didn't come either.

08:19.957 --> 08:21.542
- Seo-jun as well?
- Yes.

08:28.674 --> 08:31.177
It's Han Seo-jun! What's he doing here?

08:31.260 --> 08:32.303
He's handsome!

08:32.386 --> 08:34.514
- Who is that?
- I don't know, but he's handsome.

08:34.597 --> 08:35.473
From Saebom High?

08:40.228 --> 08:42.772
Seo-jun! Han Seo-jun!

08:42.855 --> 08:44.315
Did you ask for me? Why?

08:44.398 --> 08:46.234
I told you you'd pay
if you messed around again.

08:46.984 --> 08:48.736
How will you make me pay for it?

08:49.487 --> 08:50.738
Take it down when I tell you nicely.

08:50.821 --> 08:51.656
Take what down?

08:51.739 --> 08:53.616
The video you showed me yesterday!

08:54.575 --> 08:56.577
You submitted it to our anonymous forum.

08:56.661 --> 08:58.079
What? Anonymous forum?

08:58.746 --> 08:59.956
What are you saying?

09:01.499 --> 09:03.668
That got posted on your anonymous forum?

09:04.252 --> 09:06.003
What? That's huge.

09:06.087 --> 09:07.922
You're here because of that?

09:08.005 --> 09:09.882
Too bad. I didn't do it.

09:09.966 --> 09:12.051
- It's not you?
- It's not me!

09:12.134 --> 09:13.594
Dumpling doesn't even go here anymore.

09:13.678 --> 09:16.180
Why would I bother submitting it
to your school's forum?

09:17.723 --> 09:20.101
No one would do such a thing
other than you.

09:22.687 --> 09:23.688
You're wrong.

09:24.855 --> 09:28.526
How do you think I figured out
Dumpling is Lim Ju-kyung?

09:34.991 --> 09:35.950
Will I…

09:37.577 --> 09:39.495
be able to get married?

10:01.392 --> 10:02.310
A savior card?

10:02.393 --> 10:04.353
Sir, did Ju-kyung drop by here?

10:05.605 --> 10:06.731
No.

10:21.621 --> 10:24.665
Goodness, dear Soo-ho is here!

10:25.166 --> 10:26.334
Good morning. Is--

10:26.417 --> 10:29.503
Why do you look so thin?

10:29.587 --> 10:31.505
- How's your leg?
- Yes, if Ju-kyung…

10:31.589 --> 10:32.715
Mr. Lee…

10:32.798 --> 10:35.301
I mean, how's your father?

10:36.177 --> 10:37.011
He's just…

10:37.678 --> 10:41.223
- I shouldn't have said anything.
- Well, if Ju-kyung…

10:41.307 --> 10:43.351
What? Ju-kyung?

10:45.478 --> 10:46.896
Nothing, I'll get going.

10:47.688 --> 10:50.316
- Goodbye.
- Don't skip your meals!

10:50.399 --> 10:52.818
Watch out for cars!
Don't get into an accident again.

10:55.112 --> 10:57.740
Wait, shouldn't he be in class?

10:58.324 --> 10:59.700
What was he doing here?

11:03.996 --> 11:04.955
Lim Ju-kyung.

11:10.002 --> 11:11.921
That brat.
She probably bought more makeup.

11:13.422 --> 11:14.382
What's this?

11:15.633 --> 11:18.552
REGISTRATION CARD
COSMETOLOGY COURSE

11:24.850 --> 11:27.937
PASSING THE MAKEUP ARTIST LICENSE
WRITTEN EXAM

11:28.020 --> 11:29.313
This brat…

11:31.607 --> 11:34.443
Su-ah, you really didn't know?

11:34.527 --> 11:36.070
You're best friends with Ju-kyung.

11:36.946 --> 11:38.656
What best friends?

11:38.739 --> 11:39.907
- Jeez.
- Come on.

11:39.990 --> 11:41.951
So she modeled pretending to be a goddess?

11:42.034 --> 11:44.245
- Right?
- How did she get Soo-ho, though?

11:44.328 --> 11:46.580
- I wouldn't date her.
- He couldn't have known about this.

11:46.664 --> 11:47.498
Want to bet?

11:47.581 --> 11:48.624
Watch your words.

11:53.129 --> 11:54.046
What?

11:57.383 --> 11:58.384
Come with me.

11:59.427 --> 12:00.594
Why?

12:00.678 --> 12:02.138
Do you want to talk here?

12:03.013 --> 12:04.390
Class is starting soon.

12:08.686 --> 12:09.895
I said, come with me.

12:12.982 --> 12:15.234
- What is it?
- Stop him.

12:15.317 --> 12:18.154
- Get the class president.
- Shouldn't we stop him?

12:18.904 --> 12:19.905
Let go.

12:21.991 --> 12:23.617
Were you this trashy?

12:26.328 --> 12:28.456
- Delete the video.
- I won't.

12:28.539 --> 12:29.707
You won't?

12:32.793 --> 12:34.420
It's none of your business.

12:34.503 --> 12:37.131
What do you think Soo-ho
will think of you if he finds out?

12:37.715 --> 12:40.217
Delete it before I tell him everything!

12:40.801 --> 12:43.345
- Go ahead, I'm not scared.
- What?

12:43.429 --> 12:45.723
And I can't delete it even if I wanted to.

12:46.557 --> 12:49.643
Will deleting it make a difference?
Didn't everyone already see it?

12:51.228 --> 12:53.105
Why are you pushing it this far?

12:53.189 --> 12:54.565
Because of Soo-ho?

12:55.483 --> 12:56.901
If he finds out,

12:56.984 --> 12:58.777
he won't even consider you as a friend.

12:58.861 --> 12:59.695
"A friend"?

13:00.362 --> 13:02.990
I have no intention
of foolishly remaining a friend

13:03.073 --> 13:05.075
and having a painful
one-sided love like you.

13:07.828 --> 13:08.704
Lim Ju-kyung.

13:10.539 --> 13:12.583
You think you destroyed her, don't you?

13:16.253 --> 13:17.796
It's you who's destroyed.

13:33.687 --> 13:35.606
- Hey, Cho-rong!
- Hey, what is it?

13:35.689 --> 13:36.565
Come out. Hurry.

13:36.649 --> 13:39.235
My small and precious poop
needs to come out

13:39.318 --> 13:41.737
- for me to do that.
- Cut it out and come out!

13:46.242 --> 13:49.245
- Come on!
- What the heck? Seriously?

13:50.079 --> 13:52.456
I hear only the forum administrator
can take down the video.

13:52.540 --> 13:53.457
Who is that?

13:53.541 --> 13:54.875
How would I know?

13:54.959 --> 13:56.043
Why do you not know?

13:56.126 --> 13:58.712
I don't even know when I can poop.
How would I know that?

13:58.796 --> 14:00.047
Then find out somehow.

14:00.130 --> 14:03.259
How can I find that… Let's see.

14:03.342 --> 14:04.969
By the way, Seo-jun.

14:06.136 --> 14:08.347
- Why are you suddenly making a fuss?
- About what?

14:08.430 --> 14:09.557
Come on.

14:10.307 --> 14:12.059
Do you like Lim Ju-kyung?

14:12.142 --> 14:13.519
What are you talking about?

14:13.602 --> 14:14.728
Just find out who it is.

14:14.812 --> 14:17.856
How do you expect me to find that out,
you idiot--

14:25.072 --> 14:27.700
Well, what's going on over in class five?

14:28.284 --> 14:31.453
How could two kids not come to school
without saying anything…

14:31.537 --> 14:34.498
Maybe it's because their teacher
is so preoccupied with love.

14:35.207 --> 14:36.208
With love?

14:39.420 --> 14:40.296
Hee-kyung,

14:41.547 --> 14:43.215
were we being selfish?

15:14.788 --> 15:15.956
Excuse me.

15:17.625 --> 15:19.376
You know this is the last stop, right?

15:33.557 --> 15:34.850
Where are you?

15:34.934 --> 15:36.894
Ju-kyung, please tell me where you are.

15:36.977 --> 15:38.312
GIRLFRIEND

16:47.798 --> 16:48.632
Excuse me.

16:49.174 --> 16:50.634
Are you still here?

16:51.218 --> 16:52.636
The last bus stopped running.

16:52.720 --> 16:54.555
It's getting late, so you should leave.

16:54.638 --> 16:55.639
It's cold, and you're…

16:56.932 --> 16:58.058
Head home soon, okay?

16:59.059 --> 17:00.060
Leave soon.

17:05.524 --> 17:08.610
BOYFRIEND: PLEASE TELL ME WHERE YOU ARE
4 MISSED CALLS FROM BOYFRIEND

17:47.399 --> 17:49.777
Your call will be forwarded to voicemail.

17:49.860 --> 17:50.903
Ju-kyung.

17:50.986 --> 17:53.030
Where are you?

17:54.656 --> 17:57.201
Just tell me where you are, please.

18:14.510 --> 18:16.637
- Hello?
- Has Ju-kyung not come home yet?

18:16.720 --> 18:17.930
No, not yet.

18:18.597 --> 18:19.431
Lim Ju-bal…

18:19.515 --> 18:21.058
Where is she at this hour?

18:21.141 --> 18:22.017
Got it.

18:38.242 --> 18:39.201
Ju-kyung!

18:46.125 --> 18:47.167
Ju-kyung.

19:37.968 --> 19:38.927
Ju-kyung.

19:43.974 --> 19:45.017
Lim Ju-kyung.

19:56.445 --> 19:58.530
PASSING THE MAKEUP ARTIST LICENSE
WRITTEN EXAM

19:58.614 --> 20:01.825
REGISTRATION CARD
COSMETOLOGY COURSE

20:02.659 --> 20:04.453
Ju-kyung, you're home now?

20:04.536 --> 20:06.872
Where have you been with your phone off?

20:06.955 --> 20:07.831
The library.

20:07.915 --> 20:09.833
- How dare you lie to me?
- Honey…

20:10.542 --> 20:13.086
You went to the beauty school, didn't you?

20:13.587 --> 20:16.006
I wondered why you were
coming home so late lately.

20:16.673 --> 20:17.799
Let's talk later.

20:17.883 --> 20:20.469
How on earth did you pay for this class?

20:21.470 --> 20:23.096
I really had a difficult day today.

20:24.139 --> 20:25.057
Let's talk tomorrow.

20:25.140 --> 20:26.058
Answer me right now!

20:26.141 --> 20:28.685
Where did you get the money
to deceive me and take this class?

20:29.269 --> 20:30.270
Ju-kyung, you're home!

20:32.147 --> 20:33.982
- I worked part-time.
- What?

20:35.192 --> 20:36.568
You worked part-time?

20:37.778 --> 20:40.572
I told you to study, but you did what?
A part-time job?

20:40.656 --> 20:42.991
Who told you to do this?

20:43.075 --> 20:45.369
I said we can talk tomorrow.
Leave me alone!

20:45.452 --> 20:46.995
Yes, honey. We can talk tomorrow.

20:47.079 --> 20:48.413
Yes, Mom.

20:48.497 --> 20:50.165
What's there to wait until tomorrow?

20:50.249 --> 20:52.334
Promise me you'll drop this makeup stuff.

20:52.417 --> 20:53.252
Come on!

20:55.712 --> 20:56.546
Why…

20:58.423 --> 21:00.092
Why does it have to be cosmetology?

21:03.512 --> 21:05.430
Do you want to live the way I do?

21:10.352 --> 21:12.562
You go get a refund tomorrow.

21:13.355 --> 21:16.024
No, I'm going to get it myself.

21:16.108 --> 21:18.610
I'll kick you out if you do this again!

21:18.694 --> 21:19.569
Got it?

21:19.653 --> 21:21.029
Why you too?

21:21.780 --> 21:23.615
What if that's what I want to learn?

21:25.367 --> 21:26.994
Why is everyone denying me things?

21:27.869 --> 21:31.415
I want to do things I like
and meet someone I like!

21:31.999 --> 21:34.042
Can't I be happy?

21:34.126 --> 21:35.794
Don't I deserve it?

21:37.754 --> 21:39.339
You brat! You come here!

21:39.423 --> 21:40.674
Honey.

21:40.757 --> 21:41.591
Ju-kyung!

21:42.592 --> 21:43.510
Honey.

21:43.593 --> 21:44.761
Let go of me!

21:45.804 --> 21:46.972
Speak to her tomorrow.

22:02.988 --> 22:04.114
Ju-kyung.

22:30.724 --> 22:32.642
How is she dating Lee Soo-ho
with that face?

22:32.726 --> 22:34.019
They don't suit each other.

22:34.102 --> 22:35.771
Wake up, Lee Soo-ho.

22:35.854 --> 22:37.606
Shouldn't we pick a new model
for the school?

22:37.689 --> 22:39.441
What if people call us a school of trolls?

22:39.524 --> 22:41.193
She's having it easy with makeup.

22:41.276 --> 22:42.611
Compared to her, I'm a goddess.

22:42.694 --> 22:46.114
Honestly, if a video of me being bullied
were on the web, I'd kill myself.

22:46.198 --> 22:49.201
Who submitted this?
Isn't it bullying to submit this video?

23:00.045 --> 23:02.672
I'm going to kill everyone
who leaves mean comments below mine.

23:03.381 --> 23:04.674
What's he doing?

23:04.758 --> 23:06.468
He looks upset.

23:07.677 --> 23:08.887
He's very upset.

23:09.971 --> 23:13.475
"I'm going to kill everyone
who leaves mean comments below mine."

23:14.476 --> 23:15.602
That's so cringe!

23:15.685 --> 23:19.648
"I'm going to kill everyone
who leaves mean comments below mine."

23:19.731 --> 23:20.982
Shut up.

23:21.066 --> 23:22.359
"Shut up."

23:23.026 --> 23:24.236
Man, seriously?

23:24.319 --> 23:25.153
Hey, Cho-rong.

23:25.862 --> 23:26.905
Cho-rong!

23:26.988 --> 23:28.573
Did you find the administrator?

23:28.657 --> 23:30.575
Hold on.

23:32.494 --> 23:34.162
If you tell me who the administrator is,

23:34.246 --> 23:36.873
I'll get you on a date
with Han Seo-jun. Not lying.

23:36.957 --> 23:39.417
What are you going to do
if you find the administrator?

23:39.501 --> 23:42.254
Are you her knight in shining armor?

23:42.337 --> 23:43.755
Seo-jun likes Lim Ju--

23:43.839 --> 23:45.132
Hey, come on.

23:45.215 --> 23:46.049
Just eat it.

23:46.133 --> 23:48.260
- It's Ju-kyung!
- Where?

23:49.719 --> 23:50.929
Hi, I'm Ju-kyung.

23:51.012 --> 23:53.807
Hi, Seo-jun. I'm not that easy.

24:07.654 --> 24:10.532
The signal will change soon.
Wait for the next signal.

24:38.059 --> 24:39.144
Me?

24:42.272 --> 24:45.150
Why are you calling?
So you can hear my voice sooner?

24:46.651 --> 24:47.736
Please stop.

24:49.196 --> 24:50.155
Don't come over.

24:51.823 --> 24:52.824
Let's talk like this.

24:54.034 --> 24:54.951
I might waver

24:55.660 --> 24:56.703
if I see your face.

24:57.370 --> 24:58.288
What's going on?

25:01.249 --> 25:02.125
We…

25:05.754 --> 25:06.922
should take a break.

25:08.131 --> 25:10.091
Out of nowhere? Why?

25:10.175 --> 25:12.177
I don't think this is right.

25:12.761 --> 25:14.763
I didn't know Ju-kyung
would take it so hard.

25:16.097 --> 25:18.183
I shouldn't have started a relationship

25:18.892 --> 25:20.810
knowing you're Ju-kyung's older sister.

25:20.894 --> 25:22.812
Hey, you're overreacting.

25:22.896 --> 25:24.648
Who breaks up over such things?

25:24.731 --> 25:25.565
I…

25:26.358 --> 25:27.984
will be transferred next year.

25:28.818 --> 25:29.945
Just for one year.

25:30.028 --> 25:32.781
One year after today, at this hour.

25:33.573 --> 25:36.076
If we still love each other then,

25:37.619 --> 25:39.037
we can see each other again.

25:39.120 --> 25:40.288
What? One year?

25:42.374 --> 25:43.416
Stop.

25:43.500 --> 25:44.876
Please stop!

25:50.799 --> 25:51.716
Goodbye.

25:59.224 --> 26:00.308
Jun-woo!

26:01.226 --> 26:02.352
Han Jun-woo!

26:04.187 --> 26:06.189
What kind of lousy breakup is this?

26:12.821 --> 26:13.947
Hey, Soo-ho!

26:17.409 --> 26:19.995
- What brings you by?
- I've known you for so long.

26:20.745 --> 26:23.915
I'm sorry for what you went through
over Se-yeon's death.

26:24.624 --> 26:26.001
I thought I should apologize.

26:26.084 --> 26:28.920
You should apologize
to Se-yeon and his family.

26:29.004 --> 26:29.963
Right.

26:30.672 --> 26:33.508
I went to see them
and asked for forgiveness.

26:34.175 --> 26:36.594
I'll spend the rest of my life
asking for forgiveness.

26:37.804 --> 26:38.680
Soo-ho,

26:39.597 --> 26:40.432
Mr. Lee truly

26:41.266 --> 26:42.267
had no idea.

26:43.852 --> 26:46.396
Even so, he took full responsibility.

26:47.063 --> 26:49.274
The issue in the past
is also a misunderstanding.

26:49.357 --> 26:50.942
He never crossed the line.

26:51.026 --> 26:53.111
Why are you explaining all this to me?

26:53.194 --> 26:54.279
He's clumsy at times,

26:54.946 --> 26:56.323
but he really cares about you.

26:56.823 --> 26:58.033
I know that for certain.

26:58.742 --> 26:59.576
So…

27:00.827 --> 27:02.078
resent me all you want.

27:02.996 --> 27:05.040
But don't hate your dad.

27:06.374 --> 27:09.085
I heard how you suffered for so long

27:10.503 --> 27:12.464
and thought I should tell you this much.

27:13.548 --> 27:14.382
I'll get going.

27:28.396 --> 27:29.981
Do you have time today?

27:30.065 --> 27:34.152
I'm leaving Korea soon
and wanted to see you before I go.

27:36.404 --> 27:38.323
- Hey, Soo-ho!
- How's Ju-kyung?

27:39.366 --> 27:40.909
She's not going to school today either.

27:40.992 --> 27:43.078
Then can you ask her to take my calls?

27:43.161 --> 27:45.830
She's not in a condition
to take calls at all.

27:48.041 --> 27:49.292
Aren't you going to school?

27:49.376 --> 27:51.336
Are you protesting
the decision about beauty school?

27:51.920 --> 27:53.546
Why is she being difficult
all of a sudden?

27:53.630 --> 27:57.884
Honey, you should just go to work.
I'll speak to her quietly later, okay?

27:59.886 --> 28:01.763
Then tell her I'll be waiting
at Prince Comics.

28:03.681 --> 28:05.100
I guess you really love her.

28:05.183 --> 28:06.976
Still, you can't skip school today too.

28:07.936 --> 28:09.312
Let's go to school.

28:09.396 --> 28:11.147
When it looks like she's doing better,

28:11.231 --> 28:13.400
I'll ask Dad to tell her
to answer your calls.

28:15.568 --> 28:16.569
Let's go.

28:20.281 --> 28:22.992
Gosh, Soo-ho,
where did you get those shoes?

28:24.661 --> 28:26.121
That was too childish of me.

28:26.621 --> 28:27.497
Forget I said that.

28:30.917 --> 28:32.836
The school website's forum is blowing up.

28:32.919 --> 28:33.837
WAKE UP, LEE SOO-HO

28:33.920 --> 28:34.838
SHE'S HAVING IT EASY WITH MAKEUP

28:34.921 --> 28:36.381
There are so many mean comments.

28:36.881 --> 28:39.342
We better close the website
for the time being.

28:39.426 --> 28:40.719
- Right?
- Yes.

28:40.802 --> 28:41.845
This is crazy.

28:42.971 --> 28:45.640
Was this the reason
she skipped school yesterday?

28:46.224 --> 28:48.059
How should we go about this?

28:48.643 --> 28:50.854
Those kids in the video
aren't even our students,

28:50.937 --> 28:52.731
so we can't penalize them for bullying.

28:52.814 --> 28:54.941
And how are we going to find
whoever posted it?

28:55.024 --> 28:55.984
Goodness gracious.

28:56.067 --> 28:58.403
What about Ju-kyung?
She didn't come today either?

28:59.070 --> 29:02.157
- No.
- A student refusing to come to school…

29:02.657 --> 29:05.076
By the looks of it, this is quite serious.

29:05.160 --> 29:08.079
Mr. Han, you should meet
with Ju-kyung's parents and talk it out.

29:08.955 --> 29:09.956
Yes, I will.

29:12.208 --> 29:15.295
What do I do with this pushover, Jun-woo?

29:15.378 --> 29:16.379
Just for one year.

29:16.463 --> 29:19.090
If we still love each other then,

29:19.174 --> 29:20.592
we can see each other again.

29:22.635 --> 29:24.512
Ms. Lim, are the meeting materials ready?

29:27.056 --> 29:29.601
One year? Get out of here.

29:30.143 --> 29:31.603
Darn it.

29:31.686 --> 29:34.063
Take your time. Please do.

29:35.774 --> 29:36.858
HER ACTUAL FACE, MAKEUP MONSTER

29:36.941 --> 29:38.151
I'M SCARED TO SEE HER IN MY DREAMS

29:43.948 --> 29:46.034
Her face is a mess.

29:46.785 --> 29:49.287
- Hey, Soo-ho.
- Good morning.

29:50.288 --> 29:51.581
Watch what you say.

29:55.668 --> 29:56.836
UGLY FACE! GROSS SMILE!

29:56.920 --> 29:58.087
Who did this?

29:59.380 --> 30:00.882
Why don't you just rip it off?

30:06.137 --> 30:07.305
How is she doing?

30:11.434 --> 30:12.393
The person

30:13.603 --> 30:14.646
who posted the video…

30:15.980 --> 30:16.815
I know.

30:17.899 --> 30:18.942
You do?

30:25.573 --> 30:29.327
I like you so much, what do I do?

30:29.410 --> 30:32.372
I find you so pretty, what do I do?

30:32.455 --> 30:34.833
Jeez. Not a great way to start the day.

30:35.667 --> 30:38.628
I'm not in the mood to smile. Stop it.

30:38.711 --> 30:41.798
Won't you smile for me?
What do you think?

30:41.881 --> 30:45.009
Don't say a thing and laugh
Giggle, giggle

30:45.093 --> 30:47.345
Seriously, I'm only laughing
thanks to you.

30:47.428 --> 30:48.596
My Tu-ah laughed!

30:48.680 --> 30:52.600
- Su-ah, I love you smiling, what do I do?
- It's okay.

30:52.684 --> 30:55.270
What do I do? What do I do?

30:55.353 --> 30:58.773
I find you so pretty, what do I do?

31:00.358 --> 31:04.028
Su-ah, I love you smiling, what do I do?

31:04.112 --> 31:07.323
I love it so much, what do I do?

31:08.157 --> 31:10.702
Hey, everyone.
Let's have the morning assembly.

31:20.753 --> 31:23.548
Ju-kyung didn't come
to school today either.

31:23.631 --> 31:26.175
Sir, are we getting a new school model?

31:26.259 --> 31:28.553
- Everyone was making a fuss.
- That's right.

31:28.636 --> 31:31.431
Ju-kyung isn't the face of Saebom High.

31:31.514 --> 31:33.349
- Totally.
- Right?

31:34.809 --> 31:37.312
Is that why you took her posters
in the hallway down?

31:40.940 --> 31:44.861
You all know why she didn't come to school
and how she must feel right now,

31:44.944 --> 31:46.237
don't you?

31:47.280 --> 31:49.699
Yet none of you are worried for her?

31:52.327 --> 31:53.995
I'm so disappointed in you.

31:54.996 --> 31:56.164
Moreover, you scare me.

31:56.247 --> 31:58.708
How can you watch a video
of a classmate being bullied,

31:58.791 --> 32:00.418
then laugh and gossip over it?

32:02.045 --> 32:04.172
The pain Ju-kyung had to endure

32:04.672 --> 32:06.257
is nothing but gossip to you?

32:14.015 --> 32:15.558
Ju-kyung, did you have lunch?

32:15.642 --> 32:16.893
You're not crying, are you?

32:16.976 --> 32:18.686
- Hey, it's Lee Soo-ho.
- Do you think it's real?

32:18.770 --> 32:19.812
They can't be dating, right?

32:19.896 --> 32:21.522
I really am dating Lim Ju-kyung.

32:22.357 --> 32:23.942
- Goodness.
- That's huge.

32:25.068 --> 32:27.612
Hey, Soo-ho,
don't you have something to say to me?

32:28.279 --> 32:29.530
Like what?

32:30.615 --> 32:32.617
Why didn't you tell me
you two were dating?

32:32.700 --> 32:35.286
You know how hard I tried
to help you two out.

32:35.370 --> 32:38.164
My heart broke for you
when I thought you got dumped.

32:38.247 --> 32:39.624
It ached so much

32:39.707 --> 32:42.835
that I even lost sleep
and worried for you.

32:42.919 --> 32:44.712
Do you even consider me your friend?

32:44.796 --> 32:46.714
Right, I'm sorry.

32:46.798 --> 32:48.549
Ju-kyung wanted to keep it a secret.

32:48.633 --> 32:50.301
But do you know what upsets me more?

32:50.385 --> 32:53.054
Seo-jun seemed to know you were dating.

32:53.137 --> 32:54.305
What about it?

32:54.889 --> 32:56.724
You're dumping me
because you made up with him.

32:56.808 --> 33:00.645
Hey, if Seo-jun and I were both drowning,
who would you save first?

33:00.728 --> 33:03.064
- You first.
- Me? You'll save me first?

33:03.147 --> 33:04.148
Seo-jun's a good swimmer.

33:04.232 --> 33:06.234
Anyway,
you said you'd save me first, right?

33:08.069 --> 33:08.903
By the way…

33:08.987 --> 33:11.489
Yes, you can ask me anything,
my best friend.

33:11.572 --> 33:14.492
How do I cheer my girlfriend up
when she's upset?

33:14.575 --> 33:16.077
I didn't want to say this again but…

33:16.160 --> 33:17.829
What do we do with you?

33:21.082 --> 33:22.000
Ju-kyung,

33:23.001 --> 33:24.127
aren't you going to eat?

33:26.087 --> 33:28.715
I taped up the registration card

33:28.798 --> 33:31.175
and it's as good as new.

33:31.759 --> 33:34.262
And I will help you convince Mom.

33:34.345 --> 33:36.597
So come out and eat something.

33:36.681 --> 33:37.640
Ju-kyung.

33:39.392 --> 33:40.226
Ju…

33:46.024 --> 33:47.608
It smells amazing.

33:49.360 --> 33:51.654
It looks amazing.
Your mouth is watering, right?

33:51.738 --> 33:53.990
Live Food Show, Dad edition!

33:54.073 --> 33:57.785
Juicy pork belly grilled by your dad!

33:57.869 --> 33:59.120
It looks delicious.

33:59.203 --> 34:00.038
Come out!

34:00.121 --> 34:02.373
You need to eat
to have the strength to fight Mom!

34:02.457 --> 34:04.709
Then you can get her approval
for beauty school.

34:04.792 --> 34:07.170
I'm going to try one myself!

34:07.253 --> 34:09.505
Come on, Ju-kyung!
Guess how good this tastes?

34:10.590 --> 34:12.842
No pork belly has been this good.

34:12.925 --> 34:15.470
Is this pork belly or ice cream?

34:15.553 --> 34:18.890
Pork belly grilled by Dad
melts in your mouth like ice cream.

34:18.973 --> 34:20.391
Try some!

34:23.311 --> 34:26.898
Seo-jun!

34:29.984 --> 34:31.319
- A…
- "A"?

34:32.111 --> 34:33.154
"A" what?

34:34.280 --> 34:35.531
Amazing?

34:35.615 --> 34:36.783
Angry?

34:37.450 --> 34:38.910
Annoying?

34:39.869 --> 34:41.579
Anonymous! The anonymous forum.

34:42.622 --> 34:44.499
- I found it.
- You found it?

34:44.582 --> 34:46.250
You found the administrator?

34:46.334 --> 34:47.543
Who is it?

34:51.547 --> 34:53.257
FRESHMAN JIN HEE-JEONG

34:56.677 --> 34:58.387
Hey, Seo-jun…

34:58.471 --> 35:01.349
Hey, wait for me! Hey!

35:01.432 --> 35:03.601
- She must be crazy!
- Stop right there!

35:03.684 --> 35:06.270
- Let go!
- You let go, you crazy freak!

35:06.354 --> 35:07.730
You're the crazy one!

35:07.814 --> 35:10.650
Even if it were submitted,
who posts such a thing on the forum?

35:10.733 --> 35:12.568
It's on the person who submitted it!

35:12.652 --> 35:14.987
Do I have to review
every single one before posting?

35:15.071 --> 35:16.656
- That little…
- Let go!

35:17.198 --> 35:19.242
Hey, you told me not to use violence!

35:19.325 --> 35:21.160
You told me not to hit anyone,
even with flowers!

35:21.244 --> 35:22.411
Who the heck are you?

35:22.495 --> 35:23.412
Let go!

35:24.455 --> 35:25.915
Take your hands off her!

35:26.791 --> 35:29.293
- What?
- It's Han Seo-jun!

35:29.377 --> 35:30.711
Seo-jun.

35:31.629 --> 35:33.881
Han Seo-jun's here!

35:33.965 --> 35:35.383
Han Seo-jun's here!

35:35.466 --> 35:37.468
Gosh, why are you stepping in, bro?

35:37.552 --> 35:40.221
- "Bro"?
- Did you know she's his sister?

35:40.304 --> 35:42.431
What did you just say to my little sister?

35:43.307 --> 35:45.309
- Your little sister?
- That's her brother?

35:45.393 --> 35:47.061
Han Go-un was Han Seo-jun's sister?

35:49.689 --> 35:50.606
What did you say?

35:50.690 --> 35:52.066
- I can't believe it.
- My gosh.

35:57.488 --> 35:58.322
Hey,

35:58.948 --> 36:00.158
are you the administrator?

36:01.492 --> 36:02.326
Yes.

36:03.911 --> 36:05.037
You'll delete it, right?

36:07.373 --> 36:08.207
Jeez.

36:08.291 --> 36:10.835
I told you
to keep your distance at school!

36:10.918 --> 36:13.462
What kind of brother would I be
if I sat back and did nothing?

36:13.963 --> 36:15.173
I held back, okay?

36:15.256 --> 36:16.674
You should have tried harder.

36:18.885 --> 36:19.886
By the way,

36:20.511 --> 36:22.763
so what if I'm your brother?
Do I embarrass you?

36:22.847 --> 36:24.140
You are clueless.

36:25.099 --> 36:27.643
People will now bother me
like they did in middle school.

36:27.727 --> 36:30.521
"Introduce me to your brother."
"Why don't you look like him?"

36:30.605 --> 36:32.607
Bring them all to me.
I'll take care of them.

36:32.690 --> 36:33.691
No, thank you.

36:33.774 --> 36:35.484
Don't you dare come to my floor.

36:36.736 --> 36:38.196
Go-un.

36:38.279 --> 36:40.615
Hey, Fly. Don't follow me around.

36:40.698 --> 36:43.951
Why? You worried for me earlier.
What is it now?

36:45.203 --> 36:46.204
Hey!

36:46.746 --> 36:48.039
What do you want?

36:48.122 --> 36:50.041
Are you still following my sister around?

36:51.292 --> 36:52.293
You're asking for it.

36:52.376 --> 36:53.211
What?

36:53.878 --> 36:55.838
I can't even have a crush on her?

36:55.922 --> 36:57.506
Have you never liked anyone before?

36:58.299 --> 37:02.386
Can you just stop loving someone
because someone gives you trouble?

37:02.470 --> 37:03.763
It's not something I can control!

37:09.769 --> 37:10.895
Goodbye.

37:30.248 --> 37:31.123
Sorry.

37:39.715 --> 37:41.259
Did something happen with you two?

37:41.926 --> 37:43.886
What? No, why?

37:45.012 --> 37:46.264
Nothing, just asking.

37:47.265 --> 37:50.101
I saw Ju-kyung's video
was deleted from the forum.

37:50.810 --> 37:52.603
It was? That's good.

37:53.354 --> 37:54.188
Let's go.

38:10.830 --> 38:11.664
Hey, Soo-ho!

38:12.373 --> 38:14.792
You came by again.

38:15.293 --> 38:17.670
I told you, I'll let you know
when she's better.

38:17.753 --> 38:20.089
You might as well set up camp out here.

38:20.881 --> 38:23.968
- Can you give this to her?
- Thanks for caring,

38:24.051 --> 38:26.095
but she's not even coming out of her room.

38:26.178 --> 38:28.806
Then she must not be eating.
You left her like that?

38:29.473 --> 38:30.808
Like I said, thanks for caring.

38:31.392 --> 38:33.311
But I'm not your errand boy.

38:33.978 --> 38:35.271
Would you like a tip?

38:43.362 --> 38:44.697
Do you want them?

38:44.780 --> 38:47.533
Soo-ho, I'd be forever…

38:48.826 --> 38:49.660
No.

38:49.744 --> 38:51.912
I can't make deals around Ju-kyung.

38:51.996 --> 38:54.915
Give it here.
I just need to give it to her, right?

39:13.517 --> 39:14.352
Ju-kyung.

39:15.436 --> 39:16.354
Ju-kyung.

39:20.900 --> 39:22.610
How can she stay so silent?

39:24.278 --> 39:27.448
Wait, Lim Ju-bal.
What if she's thinking of ending it all?

39:28.199 --> 39:29.200
Ju-kyung!

39:29.867 --> 39:30.951
No!

39:31.952 --> 39:32.787
Ju-kyung!

39:33.496 --> 39:35.373
Ju-kyung, you can't do that!

39:35.456 --> 39:36.749
Ju-kyung, don't think…

39:36.832 --> 39:37.666
What?

39:39.543 --> 39:43.506
- What are you doing?
- Ju-kyung, you scared me!

39:44.882 --> 39:46.300
Hey, wait.

39:47.760 --> 39:49.220
Soo-ho brought this for you.

39:49.804 --> 39:51.972
You should eat something. Okay?

39:56.977 --> 39:59.480
Soo-ho has been waiting outside
since yesterday.

39:59.563 --> 40:01.357
Can you at least answer his calls?

40:30.594 --> 40:32.930
I was going to come see you anyway,
Mr. Han.

40:34.140 --> 40:37.560
Actually, Ju-kyung plans to
study cosmetology or some such…

40:37.643 --> 40:39.937
I can't even tell you how upset I am.

40:40.020 --> 40:42.565
She even got a part-time job
and took a course in secret.

40:42.648 --> 40:43.482
I can't even…

40:44.191 --> 40:45.443
Did you know about that?

40:46.944 --> 40:48.279
Ma'am, well…

40:49.071 --> 40:51.866
The reason I asked you here
is regarding a different issue.

40:53.409 --> 40:54.785
A different issue?

40:58.289 --> 41:00.416
This might come as a shock to you,

41:01.417 --> 41:03.752
but Ju-kyung is in a difficult situation,

41:04.962 --> 41:07.173
and I thought you should be aware of it.

41:32.907 --> 41:33.782
Is that…

41:35.201 --> 41:36.744
my Ju-kyung?

41:42.166 --> 41:44.168
This isn't CG or anything like that?

41:47.338 --> 41:48.172
It's really…

41:49.548 --> 41:50.799
my Ju-kyung…

41:55.763 --> 41:56.597
Ju-kyung.

42:15.199 --> 42:16.200
Lim Ju-kyung?

42:22.957 --> 42:24.124
You're here.

42:25.584 --> 42:27.336
Did you wait in this cold weather?

42:27.836 --> 42:28.837
You could have called.

42:30.047 --> 42:31.674
I have something to ask you.

42:33.842 --> 42:34.802
Something to ask me?

42:35.970 --> 42:38.013
There's no way you would…

42:39.557 --> 42:41.642
But I kept having these scary thoughts.

42:44.645 --> 42:45.521
Su-jin,

42:48.399 --> 42:49.608
it's not you, is it?

42:53.153 --> 42:54.572
My secret past…

42:55.948 --> 42:58.742
Me dating Soo-ho…

42:59.702 --> 43:01.078
you're the only one who knows.

43:03.289 --> 43:05.666
The only person I can think of is you.

43:07.960 --> 43:09.378
But you didn't do it, did you?

43:10.170 --> 43:12.339
You didn't submit the video
to the forum, right?

43:12.423 --> 43:14.216
If you don't think it's me,
then why are you here?

43:16.468 --> 43:18.470
I want to hear you say
that you didn't do it.

43:21.932 --> 43:22.933
It's a shame.

43:23.726 --> 43:25.144
I won't be able to say it.

43:26.770 --> 43:27.730
Why…

43:30.649 --> 43:31.900
Why did you do that?

43:33.611 --> 43:36.405
Why would you do that to me?

43:36.488 --> 43:38.907
I hate seeing you by his side.

43:41.327 --> 43:42.161
What?

43:42.661 --> 43:45.289
Didn't you run to my school
after that incident at Yongpa High?

43:45.789 --> 43:47.583
Why don't you run this time too?

43:48.292 --> 43:49.335
You're good at that.

43:50.544 --> 43:54.882
Run away as far as you can and hide.

43:55.799 --> 43:57.092
I mean it.

45:09.832 --> 45:13.794
RESERVED FOR LIM JU-KYUNG.
SIT HERE AND YOU'LL GROW BUTT HAIR.

45:40.988 --> 45:43.365
I've sorted all the books.
Is there anything else?

45:43.449 --> 45:46.493
I said, there's no need.
Just sit and read comic books.

45:46.577 --> 45:47.911
Time flies when you're busy.

45:47.995 --> 45:50.956
That's what I'm saying.
Why are you killing time here?

45:51.039 --> 45:53.041
Be honest. Ju-bal dumped you, right?

45:53.125 --> 45:54.543
- No.
- Please.

45:54.626 --> 45:57.463
When a guy waits for a girl
in front of her place endlessly,

45:58.046 --> 45:59.381
it's all the same story.

45:59.465 --> 46:00.424
It's not like that.

46:01.717 --> 46:02.843
It's frustrating, right?

46:04.386 --> 46:05.304
Pick a card.

46:05.387 --> 46:07.973
I'll read her mind for you.

46:08.557 --> 46:09.433
No thanks.

46:09.516 --> 46:11.894
It's not like
you have better things to do.

46:11.977 --> 46:13.145
Just pick one.

46:28.327 --> 46:30.954
It's The Lovers card.

46:31.830 --> 46:34.082
What was the reading for it
when upside down?

46:34.666 --> 46:35.501
Hold on.

46:45.636 --> 46:49.431
UPSIDE DOWN INTERPRETATION
PARTING

47:18.293 --> 47:19.336
Ju-kyung.

47:19.419 --> 47:20.671
Where have you been?

47:21.380 --> 47:22.756
Just around the neighborhood.

47:23.340 --> 47:24.174
What about dinner?

47:24.758 --> 47:25.634
I'm skipping it.

47:27.970 --> 47:29.555
Why would you skip a meal? You…

47:36.144 --> 47:37.563
My little girl…

47:39.106 --> 47:40.065
Mom.

47:41.358 --> 47:42.901
Mom went to school.

47:46.363 --> 47:48.657
Why didn't you tell me?

47:49.199 --> 47:50.951
You should have told me about it.

47:51.034 --> 47:53.120
Why did you hold onto that
all by yourself?

47:54.788 --> 47:56.832
I didn't because I knew
you'd react this way.

47:57.624 --> 47:58.750
How could I?

47:58.834 --> 48:01.878
Still, you should have told me.

48:03.422 --> 48:06.550
I had no idea my baby
was being treated like that.

48:17.102 --> 48:18.061
Who are they?

48:18.145 --> 48:20.230
I'm going to find them
and get back at them!

48:20.314 --> 48:22.316
Who are they? Tell me everything. Come on.

48:22.399 --> 48:23.650
Come on, Mom.

48:23.734 --> 48:25.360
Mom, stop crying.

48:26.028 --> 48:27.904
You're upsetting Ju-kyung.

48:29.698 --> 48:32.784
It must have been so difficult for you.

48:40.208 --> 48:41.043
Did

48:42.836 --> 48:43.670
they

48:44.671 --> 48:45.631
hit you?

48:46.506 --> 48:48.300
Where did they hit you?

48:49.635 --> 48:51.470
Come on, tell me everything.

48:52.929 --> 48:53.764
No,

48:54.431 --> 48:55.891
I wasn't hit.

48:56.683 --> 48:58.852
It's all in the past. I'm all right.

49:00.354 --> 49:01.563
I'm all right.

49:08.445 --> 49:09.696
My baby girl.

49:12.491 --> 49:13.867
I'm sorry.

49:36.515 --> 49:40.811
I had no idea
because she's always smiling.

49:43.689 --> 49:46.149
It's all because I was so tough on her.

49:46.692 --> 49:49.695
I scared her so much that
she couldn't even confide in her own mom.

49:50.487 --> 49:51.822
It's all my fault.

49:51.905 --> 49:53.657
How is that your fault?

49:57.703 --> 49:59.204
Right after I had Ju-kyung,

49:59.913 --> 50:02.249
I got pregnant with Ju-young.

50:02.332 --> 50:04.334
I left her with her grandparents
in the countryside

50:04.418 --> 50:05.877
and let them do the hard work.

50:06.503 --> 50:09.131
That's why she grew up
hearing things like she was adopted.

50:11.049 --> 50:14.428
She's not being loved in the world
because she wasn't loved enough at home.

50:16.972 --> 50:21.768
I didn't raise her like a princess,
nor let her feel pretty and valued.

50:21.852 --> 50:24.229
It's all my fault.

50:24.312 --> 50:26.106
Who else's fault is it?

50:28.275 --> 50:29.443
It's my fault.

50:30.527 --> 50:32.237
I made you work to the bone,

50:32.988 --> 50:35.282
leaving you with no time
to care for the kids.

50:36.283 --> 50:38.243
I gave her such a hard time
over her makeup.

50:39.619 --> 50:42.706
There was a reason she made such a fuss
when I threw her makeup away.

50:50.756 --> 50:52.841
I'm sorry I didn't realize
what you were going through.

50:56.720 --> 50:57.888
It's nothing.

50:58.638 --> 51:00.432
Don't pay any attention to those punks.

51:01.433 --> 51:03.769
Only you can decide your own worth.

51:03.852 --> 51:06.271
As long as you're sure of yourself,
no one can touch you.

51:06.354 --> 51:07.189
Understand?

51:11.818 --> 51:13.361
Stop crying and go to sleep.

52:21.972 --> 52:22.848
Get out.

52:23.431 --> 52:24.808
- Why?
- Come on, get out.

52:26.184 --> 52:29.521
- Where are we going?
- Enough with the chatter and follow me.

52:30.272 --> 52:31.106
Gosh.

52:41.992 --> 52:43.577
Can you take off your glasses?

52:52.252 --> 52:54.754
We might need some extensive surgery.

52:55.422 --> 52:58.967
Whatever it takes to make her
as pretty as a goddess.

52:59.634 --> 53:01.219
- A goddess…
- Mom.

53:03.930 --> 53:06.558
Well, she already has double eyelids.

53:06.641 --> 53:08.476
With a non-incisional eye correction,

53:08.560 --> 53:10.312
we'll have her eyes pop more.

53:11.563 --> 53:12.981
A slit in the front,

53:13.481 --> 53:14.774
and a slit in the back.

53:15.442 --> 53:16.568
Her eyes will be larger,

53:16.651 --> 53:18.361
just like they've been photoshopped.

53:19.195 --> 53:23.408
As for her nose,
the bridge will be lifted using silicone.

53:23.491 --> 53:26.077
The tip of her nose
will be made more pointy

53:26.161 --> 53:29.164
with the cartilage
collected from her left ear.

53:29.247 --> 53:32.334
But her nose is as cute as a button.

53:33.126 --> 53:34.961
Her nose has been complimented a lot.

53:36.671 --> 53:38.965
From a medical point of view,

53:39.966 --> 53:41.217
it's not pretty at all.

53:43.803 --> 53:46.306
Okay, we can also cut the hairline

53:46.389 --> 53:47.599
and give her a face-lift

53:47.682 --> 53:50.101
by pulling up the skin as much as we can.

53:50.185 --> 53:52.354
Then we can take some fat
from her buttocks

53:52.437 --> 53:55.523
and inject it into her forehead,
chin, and cheekbones.

53:57.943 --> 54:00.111
With the fat injection
all around her face,

54:00.195 --> 54:03.615
her rather flat face
will look more three-dimensional.

54:03.698 --> 54:05.450
What's the point? She's not a foreigner.

54:06.868 --> 54:10.121
Double jaw surgery
will shave her jawline off,

54:10.205 --> 54:11.581
making the cheekbones slimmer…

54:11.665 --> 54:14.834
Her face isn't an apple.
What's there to shave off?

54:14.918 --> 54:17.545
That way her jawline
will look slimmer, like a V.

54:17.629 --> 54:20.799
They say a pronounced jaw
brings you luck in your later years.

54:20.882 --> 54:22.676
What would you have me do, then?

54:23.551 --> 54:25.470
To be honest, to make this face pretty,

54:25.553 --> 54:28.139
you need to start from the ground up.

54:28.223 --> 54:31.184
She's not a redevelopment project.
There's no need for groundwork.

54:31.267 --> 54:33.228
Those slits and cuts will make her pretty?

54:33.311 --> 54:36.231
Who set the standard
of beauty and ugliness?

54:36.314 --> 54:38.316
My daughter looks pretty to me.

54:38.400 --> 54:41.361
Come on, Mom. Let's just leave, okay?

54:41.444 --> 54:43.405
Goodness, I could give you a simulation.

54:43.989 --> 54:45.949
To make her pretty like so,

54:46.449 --> 54:48.994
starting from the ground up
is the only way.

54:49.077 --> 54:50.078
My goodness!

54:50.161 --> 54:52.789
A ton of money
will have her look like this?

54:52.872 --> 54:55.250
She can get that face
just by putting makeup on.

54:56.042 --> 54:57.002
Gosh,

54:57.085 --> 54:59.921
plastic surgery is no better
than her makeup skills.

55:00.755 --> 55:01.631
Let's go.

55:01.715 --> 55:03.675
Why put a knife to a perfectly fine face?

55:05.552 --> 55:06.469
Wait…

55:10.515 --> 55:12.726
What? A goddess?

55:30.160 --> 55:32.328
I heard everyone at your school
saw the video.

55:35.915 --> 55:37.125
Don't you worry.

55:37.208 --> 55:39.919
I'll get you transferred
to somewhere no one knows you.

55:41.546 --> 55:42.380
What?

55:59.481 --> 56:01.941
PRINCE COMICS

56:03.109 --> 56:05.278
Why don't you run this time too?

56:05.862 --> 56:07.322
You're good at that.

56:07.405 --> 56:12.035
Run away as far as you can and hide.

56:12.118 --> 56:13.411
I mean it.

56:21.920 --> 56:22.837
It's Ju-kyung.

56:33.765 --> 56:34.599
Did you cry?

56:35.642 --> 56:36.559
No.

56:39.687 --> 56:41.397
Then why won't you show me your face?

56:43.024 --> 56:44.734
It's because I feel bad for you.

56:45.401 --> 56:46.277
For what?

56:46.361 --> 56:47.779
I made you the target

56:48.404 --> 56:50.281
of all those mean comments for no reason.

56:52.742 --> 56:54.786
That's why I can't look you in the eye.

56:54.869 --> 56:56.871
But still, show me your face.

57:00.250 --> 57:01.835
I kept waiting for…

57:01.918 --> 57:04.170
Squirrel.

57:07.090 --> 57:08.007
You're not going to…

57:08.091 --> 57:10.176
Meow.

57:11.928 --> 57:14.347
That's from ages ago.

57:16.599 --> 57:17.767
You still don't remember.

57:18.393 --> 57:19.227
What?

57:24.524 --> 57:25.567
I'm so relieved.

57:28.820 --> 57:30.155
I missed you so much.

57:45.962 --> 57:46.796
Let's get out.

57:47.380 --> 57:49.632
- What?
- You can't hide here forever.

57:49.716 --> 57:50.633
Let's go.

57:57.807 --> 57:59.142
Are you tired already?

57:59.225 --> 58:01.853
Yes. Why don't we just go back?

58:04.147 --> 58:05.273
Use your strength.

58:05.356 --> 58:06.441
The thing is…

58:06.941 --> 58:09.068
I haven't eaten anything,

58:09.152 --> 58:10.361
so I have no strength.

58:11.237 --> 58:12.155
This won't do.

58:12.238 --> 58:14.115
Okay, let's just go back.

58:15.366 --> 58:17.410
I said, let's just go back.

58:18.536 --> 58:20.788
- I'm heavy.
- Let's go.

58:20.872 --> 58:22.624
Hey, I'm pretty heavy.

58:28.254 --> 58:30.798
How do you feel?
It's better to be outside, right?

58:30.882 --> 58:33.551
Yes, it's nice.

58:34.636 --> 58:35.470
That day…

58:36.429 --> 58:37.555
Why did you run away?

58:39.974 --> 58:41.601
You have me by your side now.

58:43.645 --> 58:44.854
So what made you run?

58:47.982 --> 58:48.858
You're right.

58:50.026 --> 58:51.402
I ran away again.

58:53.988 --> 58:55.782
I guess I just wanted to hide.

58:55.865 --> 58:58.409
But why would you?
You didn't do anything wrong.

58:58.493 --> 58:59.994
Because I was embarrassed.

59:01.913 --> 59:03.248
People now know

59:04.082 --> 59:06.459
about my true face.

59:08.711 --> 59:10.213
What do I do now?

59:13.007 --> 59:15.176
Then is your face with makeup
not your face?

59:17.345 --> 59:19.472
Whatever you look like,

59:19.556 --> 59:21.140
with or without makeup,

59:22.225 --> 59:23.643
you're always you, Ju-kyung.

59:27.397 --> 59:28.940
I read this somewhere.

59:29.899 --> 59:33.278
Do you know which country
has the best tomatoes?

59:35.154 --> 59:36.239
It's Spain.

59:39.242 --> 59:40.868
- Is it?
- Yes.

59:40.952 --> 59:45.164
Spain is the worst place
for tomatoes to survive,

59:45.248 --> 59:46.416
making them taste better.

59:47.250 --> 59:48.084
How?

59:48.710 --> 59:50.086
It's the worst place for them.

59:50.753 --> 59:51.629
That's exactly why.

59:53.214 --> 59:55.466
As they struggle to survive,

59:56.092 --> 59:57.218
they become stronger

59:58.219 --> 59:59.971
and grow more fragrant.

01:00:01.681 --> 01:00:02.640
I see.

01:00:04.767 --> 01:00:06.102
You know,

01:00:06.185 --> 01:00:09.480
fruits with bruises and lumps

01:00:09.564 --> 01:00:11.232
tend to be more delicious and sweet.

01:00:12.859 --> 01:00:14.444
Don't you think it's the same with people?

01:00:17.155 --> 01:00:18.990
Are you saying I'm ugly?

01:00:19.741 --> 01:00:20.575
Yes.

01:00:22.035 --> 01:00:23.119
I'm kidding.

01:00:24.037 --> 01:00:25.330
I'm not entirely sure,

01:00:27.624 --> 01:00:29.542
but you are tougher than you think.

01:00:32.545 --> 01:00:33.630
Even more so than I am.

01:00:40.762 --> 01:00:44.057
I plan on growing tough
like you from now on.

01:01:13.461 --> 01:01:15.088
Why did I come here?

01:01:18.257 --> 01:01:19.384
They fit you perfectly.

01:01:19.467 --> 01:01:21.469
I wanted you to wear these and come to me.

01:01:22.053 --> 01:01:25.515
I'll be good to you.
Come to me and be my man, Han Jun-woo.

01:01:30.436 --> 01:01:31.437
My feet…

01:01:32.772 --> 01:01:34.565
keep carrying me to you, Hee-kyung.

01:01:47.453 --> 01:01:48.621
Oh no.

01:01:53.751 --> 01:01:54.794
Hee-kyung!

01:01:55.378 --> 01:01:56.212
Hey.

01:01:56.963 --> 01:01:58.047
What brings you here?

01:01:58.131 --> 01:02:00.049
Your company got a lot of lawsuits filed.

01:02:01.050 --> 01:02:03.052
- I see.
- Are you off now?

01:02:03.886 --> 01:02:05.596
It's about time for you to be hungry.

01:02:06.139 --> 01:02:07.765
Do you want to have dinner with me?

01:02:07.849 --> 01:02:10.393
We're not on terms
to have dinner together, are we?

01:02:10.476 --> 01:02:12.103
Why not?

01:02:12.186 --> 01:02:13.855
It's not like I asked you out again.

01:02:13.938 --> 01:02:15.857
I'm just asking you
to have a meal with me.

01:02:15.940 --> 01:02:17.900
Or have you got a boyfriend now?

01:02:17.984 --> 01:02:19.444
A boyfriend?

01:02:26.659 --> 01:02:27.660
Of course, I don't.

01:02:28.745 --> 01:02:31.664
For a year, I do, but I don't.

01:02:32.790 --> 01:02:34.751
Let's have dinner then.
Where should we go?

01:02:34.834 --> 01:02:36.085
You like spicy food.

01:02:36.169 --> 01:02:38.004
- Let's get something spicy.
- Sounds good.

01:03:32.350 --> 01:03:33.434
LIM JU-KYUNG

01:03:33.518 --> 01:03:34.560
Are you all right?

01:03:45.071 --> 01:03:46.113
LEE SOO-HO

01:03:46.197 --> 01:03:47.490
Is Ju-kyung all right?

01:03:50.493 --> 01:03:51.869
The video got deleted.

01:04:06.676 --> 01:04:08.594
Are you not going to school
again tomorrow?

01:04:09.929 --> 01:04:11.931
Mom said she'll get me transferred.

01:04:12.014 --> 01:04:12.849
What?

01:04:13.432 --> 01:04:14.892
I'm sure she didn't mean it.

01:04:15.643 --> 01:04:18.104
How is that possible?
I doubt we can afford to move.

01:04:21.941 --> 01:04:23.568
I don't want to go in.

01:04:24.861 --> 01:04:27.238
Seeing my mom upset

01:04:27.321 --> 01:04:29.657
breaks my heart and makes me feel sorry.

01:04:32.118 --> 01:04:33.703
Will you spend the night out then?

01:04:34.787 --> 01:04:35.997
That would work for me.

01:04:38.457 --> 01:04:39.584
I'll go in.

01:04:41.627 --> 01:04:42.503
Wait.

01:04:47.800 --> 01:04:48.843
Here.

01:04:50.887 --> 01:04:54.849
Make sure she sleeps well tonight
without any worries.

01:04:55.558 --> 01:04:56.392
Okay?

01:05:06.986 --> 01:05:09.030
- I'll see you tomorrow.
- Okay.

01:05:09.989 --> 01:05:11.282
I'm really going in.

01:05:40.394 --> 01:05:42.146
BOYFRIEND

01:05:54.951 --> 01:05:59.038
I like you so much, what do I do?

01:05:59.121 --> 01:06:02.500
I find you so pretty, what do I do?

01:06:02.583 --> 01:06:05.044
Won't you smile for me?

01:06:05.127 --> 01:06:06.796
What do you think?

01:06:06.879 --> 01:06:09.215
Don't say a thing and laugh

01:06:09.298 --> 01:06:11.175
READ

01:06:19.141 --> 01:06:23.187
I find you so pretty, what do I do?

01:06:23.270 --> 01:06:27.358
Su-ah, I love you smiling, what do I do?

01:06:47.420 --> 01:06:51.549
I like you so much, what do I do?

01:06:51.632 --> 01:06:56.178
I find you so pretty, what do I do?

01:06:56.262 --> 01:06:57.888
Don't say a thing and laugh

01:06:57.972 --> 01:06:59.181
What do you think?

01:07:07.523 --> 01:07:11.610
I like you so much, what do I do?

01:07:11.694 --> 01:07:15.448
I find you so pretty, what do I do?

01:07:15.531 --> 01:07:19.577
Won't you smile for me?
What do you think?

01:07:19.660 --> 01:07:23.914
Don't say a thing and laugh
Giggle, giggle

01:07:37.720 --> 01:07:39.305
I guess he left.

01:07:45.102 --> 01:07:46.437
Soo-ho.

01:07:54.320 --> 01:07:55.362
Why did you come out?

01:07:56.822 --> 01:07:57.948
What's this?

01:08:00.534 --> 01:08:01.368
I'll be off then.

01:08:07.333 --> 01:08:09.877
- Hurry back in. You'll catch a cold.
- Okay.

01:08:11.128 --> 01:08:12.004
Good night.

01:08:13.839 --> 01:08:15.049
Good night.

01:09:05.391 --> 01:09:07.351
I know it can't happen anytime soon,

01:09:08.060 --> 01:09:11.105
but I hope you'll speak to him
at least once.

01:09:17.278 --> 01:09:21.115
I'm leaving Korea soon
and wanted to see you before I go.

01:09:21.824 --> 01:09:24.201
I don't want you to have regrets.

01:09:35.504 --> 01:09:36.630
Thank you.

01:09:52.897 --> 01:09:53.939
Hi, Soo-ho.

01:09:54.023 --> 01:09:55.357
I'm in front of your place.

01:09:56.150 --> 01:09:57.026
Are you home?

01:09:57.109 --> 01:09:58.110
Home?

01:10:00.279 --> 01:10:02.781
- You're in front of my place?
- Yes.

01:10:02.865 --> 01:10:05.826
Oh no, I just arrived at the airport.

01:10:05.910 --> 01:10:07.953
I'll be in the States for a while.

01:10:09.580 --> 01:10:12.166
- There are too many reporters--
- When are you coming back?

01:10:12.249 --> 01:10:15.836
I have to wrap something up at work,
so I'll come back in a month.

01:10:18.214 --> 01:10:19.048
I see.

01:10:19.131 --> 01:10:20.299
Soo-ho…

01:10:22.426 --> 01:10:23.344
What do you think

01:10:24.011 --> 01:10:26.263
about staying with me in the States?

01:10:26.972 --> 01:10:28.182
You can study music there.

01:10:28.265 --> 01:10:29.600
I'd rather not.

01:10:29.683 --> 01:10:31.477
I'll see you when you're back in Korea.

01:10:32.144 --> 01:10:33.020
When you're back…

01:10:35.022 --> 01:10:36.565
treat me to a nice meal.

01:10:39.235 --> 01:10:40.402
Hanging up now.

01:10:40.486 --> 01:10:41.654
Hey, Soo-ho.

01:10:43.489 --> 01:10:44.323
Sure.

01:10:45.115 --> 01:10:46.867
I'll see you when I'm back in Korea.

01:11:00.172 --> 01:11:01.090
- Mr. Kang.
- Yes, sir.

01:11:01.173 --> 01:11:03.384
Make a reservation
for the day I return to Korea.

01:11:03.467 --> 01:11:04.301
Yes, sir.

01:11:04.385 --> 01:11:06.136
No, I'll handle that myself.

01:11:06.220 --> 01:11:08.138
Can you find out
what kids like these days?

01:11:08.222 --> 01:11:09.348
Of course, sir.

01:11:09.431 --> 01:11:11.433
- It's Lee Ju-hun.
- That is Lee Ju-hun, right?

01:11:19.692 --> 01:11:21.068
Breakfast is ready!

01:11:21.694 --> 01:11:23.112
Gosh, something smells so good.

01:11:23.696 --> 01:11:25.239
It wafts into your rooms, right?

01:11:25.322 --> 01:11:26.991
Yes. Is it someone's birthday today?

01:11:27.074 --> 01:11:28.993
It's not. I made this for Ju-kyung.

01:11:29.076 --> 01:11:31.203
She hasn't eaten properly for days now.

01:11:33.330 --> 01:11:37.084
I see Ju-kyung's favorite dish, bulgogi!

01:11:38.794 --> 01:11:40.254
Stir-fried glass noodles too!

01:11:40.337 --> 01:11:43.382
I guess Mom made
all of Ju-kyung's favorite dishes!

01:11:49.555 --> 01:11:50.723
Hey, Lim Ju-bal…

01:11:53.600 --> 01:11:55.978
Ju-kyung. Come down and have breakfast.

01:11:58.147 --> 01:11:59.106
Ju-kyung?

01:12:00.816 --> 01:12:02.484
Lim Ju-bal, why are you not…

01:12:02.985 --> 01:12:04.028
answering?

01:12:05.696 --> 01:12:06.530
What?

01:12:07.114 --> 01:12:07.990
When did she leave?

01:12:24.214 --> 01:12:25.632
- It's insane.
- What?

01:12:40.981 --> 01:12:42.816
- What?
- Why did she come like that?

01:12:56.413 --> 01:12:58.457
She came here without makeup on?

01:12:58.540 --> 01:12:59.625
She has no makeup on?

01:13:12.137 --> 01:13:13.305
Hey, look.

01:13:18.102 --> 01:13:19.103
She sure is confident.

01:13:20.270 --> 01:13:22.106
- Is that really Ju-kyung?
- It's Ju-kyung.

01:13:31.448 --> 01:13:32.658
- Is that Ju-kyung?
- No way.

01:13:33.367 --> 01:13:35.369
- What?
- It's her. Look.

01:13:49.341 --> 01:13:51.301
- Hi, Ju-kyung.
- Are you all right?

01:13:51.385 --> 01:13:52.803
Yes.

01:13:52.886 --> 01:13:54.930
Ju-kyung, you're seriously so cool.

01:13:55.013 --> 01:13:56.890
You really are a strong woman.

01:14:00.310 --> 01:14:01.520
Hey, Su-ah!

01:14:02.980 --> 01:14:05.107
Su-ah!

01:14:05.190 --> 01:14:06.150
Where are you going?

01:14:06.233 --> 01:14:07.401
Choi Su-ah!

01:14:08.277 --> 01:14:09.570
Su-ah!

01:14:09.653 --> 01:14:12.114
Su-ah!

01:14:19.663 --> 01:14:22.291
Hey, I heard Lim Ju-kyung
came to school without makeup on.

01:14:22.916 --> 01:14:24.084
She's so full of herself.

01:14:24.168 --> 01:14:26.170
Do you really think
she's dating Lee Soo-ho?

01:14:26.253 --> 01:14:28.839
I saw her face earlier
and it was worse than the pictures.

01:14:28.922 --> 01:14:30.924
- Right.
- They would've broken up by now.

01:14:31.008 --> 01:14:33.010
How could he date her
after seeing that face?

01:14:33.093 --> 01:14:34.553
Isn't he also lame lately?

01:14:34.636 --> 01:14:36.013
His dad is a has-been.

01:14:36.096 --> 01:14:38.682
I guess he's just out of his mind
and dating anyone now.

01:14:38.765 --> 01:14:40.601
- Gosh, that was harsh.
- What?

01:14:40.684 --> 01:14:42.478
- Let's go.
- Sure, let's!

01:14:43.770 --> 01:14:46.190
- Hey, what's that?
- Hey.

01:15:00.537 --> 01:15:01.455
Hey, you!

01:15:03.582 --> 01:15:04.750
Take back what you just said.

01:15:05.417 --> 01:15:06.919
- Who is she?
- Who is this?

01:15:07.711 --> 01:15:08.670
Lim Ju-kyung?

01:15:09.254 --> 01:15:12.132
Hey, are you crazy,
going around without makeup on?

01:15:12.216 --> 01:15:13.634
You're not taking it back?

01:15:13.717 --> 01:15:16.094
Yes. I'm dating Lee Soo-ho.

01:15:16.678 --> 01:15:18.514
Lee Soo-ho is my boyfriend!

01:15:19.556 --> 01:15:22.226
Happy? Did that satisfy your curiosity?

01:15:22.309 --> 01:15:24.228
- She must have gone crazy.
- Right?

01:15:25.187 --> 01:15:28.607
He doesn't judge people by their looks,

01:15:28.690 --> 01:15:31.360
and he likes me for who I am,
no matter what I look like.

01:15:31.443 --> 01:15:34.154
He's a way better person
than you mean and awful people.

01:15:34.238 --> 01:15:37.115
So don't talk behind his back
and put him down for dating me.

01:15:37.199 --> 01:15:38.992
Say it all straight to my face!

01:15:39.076 --> 01:15:40.702
I'll take you all down. Got it?

01:15:40.786 --> 01:15:42.871
- That was brilliant.
- So courageous!

01:15:43.664 --> 01:15:45.916
And if you have time
to judge others' looks,

01:15:45.999 --> 01:15:47.584
try studying instead!

01:15:47.668 --> 01:15:49.670
Do you know who comes after King Sejong?

01:15:49.753 --> 01:15:51.797
- You don't, do you?
- Is it Shin Saimdang?

01:15:51.880 --> 01:15:53.966
So ignorant. Step aside!

01:16:54.943 --> 01:16:56.945
THANK YOU TO LEE HAN-WI
FOR HIS SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:17:20.344 --> 01:17:21.470
EPILOGUE

01:17:21.553 --> 01:17:23.472
Hey, I'm hungry.

01:17:23.555 --> 01:17:26.350
Hey, then do you want to go
get some tteokbokki?

01:17:26.433 --> 01:17:27.517
- Sure.
- Sounds great.

01:17:28.268 --> 01:17:29.227
Excuse me.

01:17:31.813 --> 01:17:33.523
Can I join you?

01:17:33.607 --> 01:17:36.443
What? You're not our friend.

01:17:37.611 --> 01:17:38.528
What's with her?

01:17:38.612 --> 01:17:39.821
- Right?
- Right?

01:17:39.905 --> 01:17:41.365
Let's go.

01:17:47.913 --> 01:17:53.210
PRINCE COMICS

01:17:53.293 --> 01:17:54.795
Are you crying?

01:17:59.716 --> 01:18:02.761
Did the book scare you that much?

01:18:04.721 --> 01:18:06.598
It's okay. Don't cry.

01:18:07.140 --> 01:18:08.517
This isn't scary at…

01:18:08.600 --> 01:18:10.519
Squirrel.

01:18:10.602 --> 01:18:12.312
I'm a squirrel.

01:18:13.438 --> 01:18:14.606
Seriously, you're not going to…

01:18:14.690 --> 01:18:19.778
Meow.

01:18:21.655 --> 01:18:22.698
You finally smiled.

01:18:22.781 --> 01:18:25.659
Squirrel. I'm a squirrel.

01:18:26.243 --> 01:18:27.703
Did you know?

01:18:27.786 --> 01:18:30.872
You'll grow butt hair
if you cry and then smile!

01:18:31.873 --> 01:18:35.585
Squirrel. I'm a squirrel.

01:18:51.017 --> 01:18:53.770
I'm only going to listen
to the people who love me.

01:18:53.854 --> 01:18:56.481
I'm not going to run or hide anymore.

01:18:57.816 --> 01:19:00.193
Ju-kyung, did you get to check
the anonymous forum?

01:19:00.277 --> 01:19:02.821
How is Kang Su-jin going to
show her face at school?

01:19:03.405 --> 01:19:04.614
Can I tell Ju-kyung

01:19:05.282 --> 01:19:06.908
how I feel about her?

01:19:06.992 --> 01:19:07.868
Tell her how you feel?

01:19:10.120 --> 01:19:11.121
Lim Ju-kyung!

01:19:11.663 --> 01:19:13.707
Why didn't you answer my calls yesterday?

01:19:14.499 --> 01:19:15.625
Hey, Lee Soo-ho!

01:19:15.709 --> 01:19:16.918
Where are you going?

01:19:17.002 --> 01:19:18.378
Why are you running away?

01:19:18.462 --> 01:19:20.464
We should break up.

01:19:20.964 --> 01:19:25.427
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
